  <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Office drylining creates flexible, modern workspaces with partition walls, feature walls, and ceiling systems across Edinburgh. Out-of-hours working, acoustic options, and 12-month guarantee.</p>
