<!-- What We Offer -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Our Office Drylining Services</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The modern office needs to be flexible. Teams grow, departments move, and workspaces need to adapt without expensive structural changes. At <strong>Drylining Edinburgh</strong>, we specialise in office drylining that creates beautiful, functional interiors using lightweight partition walls, feature walls, and modern ceiling systems. Edinburgh's thriving business community — from financial services firms in St James to tech companies in Leith Waterfront and professional services in the New Town — demands workspace solutions that are both professional and adaptable.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Open-plan to cellular office conversions</li>
  <li>Meeting room and boardroom drylining</li>
  <li>Reception and breakout area feature walls</li>
  <li>Acoustic partitions for noise control</li>
  <li>Suspended ceilings with integrated lighting</li>
  <li>Glass partition integration with drylining</li>
  <li>Branded wall finishes and decorative features</li>
  <li>Out-of-hours and weekend working available</li>
</ul>

<!-- Why Choose Us -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Our Office Drylining?</h2>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>Minimal business disruption:</strong> We understand that office refurbishments need to happen with minimal impact. Our team can work evenings, weekends, or in phased sections to keep your business running smoothly.</li>
  <li><strong>Flexible workspace design:</strong> Drylined partitions can be reconfigured as your team grows, without the cost and mess of traditional building work.</li>
  <li><strong>Acoustic solutions:</strong> We install sound-rated partitions and acoustic ceiling tiles to create quiet meeting rooms and productive workspaces in open-plan environments.</li>
  <li><strong>Modern aesthetics:</strong> From sleek glass integration to branded feature walls, our office drylining creates spaces that reflect your company culture and impress clients.</li>
  <li><strong>Fast turnaround:</strong> Drylining is significantly faster than traditional construction, meaning your new office layout is ready in days, not weeks.</li>
  <li><strong>Edinburgh market knowledge:</strong> We work across Edinburgh's main business districts — Princes Street, George Street, St James, Leith Waterfront, Fountainbridge, and the Financial District — understanding the unique requirements of each area.</li>
</ul>

<!-- Materials -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Materials & Specifications</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">We use industry-leading products to ensure your office interiors look professional and perform flawlessly.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
