  <li>Knauf plasterboard and jointing systems</li>
  <li>Metal C-studs and U-tracks for partition framing</li>
  <li>Acoustic insulation for meeting rooms and private offices</li>
  <li>Fire-rated plasterboard and cavity barriers for compliance</li>
