<!-- FAQ -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Frequently Asked Questions about Office Drylining</h2>
<div>
  <div style="padding:20px;margin-bottom:12px;background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);">
    <h3 style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--primary);">What is office drylining?</h3>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-light);margin:0;">Office drylining is the installation of plasterboard partition walls, feature walls, and ceiling systems to create modern, flexible office interiors. It is faster and cleaner than traditional construction methods.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="padding:20px;margin-bottom:12px;background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);">
    <h3 style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--primary);">Can you convert open-plan offices to cellular layouts?</h3>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-light);margin:0;">Yes. We specialise in converting open-plan spaces into private offices, meeting rooms, and breakout areas using drylined partition walls with acoustic and fire-rated options.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="padding:20px;margin-bottom:12px;background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);">
    <h3 style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--primary);">How long does an office drylining project take?</h3>
